s","Shopping","Local Flavor","Souvenir Shops"],"is_open":true},"evidence":{"source":"frozen-model","summary":{"business_id":"0uxg3_noVCE78Wgjb8DSyA","user_id":"D76EFdD5F7XoIIyQmWTQhA","user_row":3279,"nv_rank":638,"mm_rank":632,"target_category_support_fraction":0.1,"selected_image_count":3,"label_diversity":1,"target_visual_score_gain":null,"target_visual_rank_gain":null,"competitive_visual_rank_effect":null},"category_overlap":[{"category":"Candy Stores","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Specialty Food","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Books","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Mags","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Music & Video","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Food","historical_business_count":3},{"category":"Bookstores","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Shopping","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Local Flavor","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Souvenir Shops","historical_business_count":0}],"history":[{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"0uxg3_noVCE78Wgjb8DSyA","review_id":"_jqyvSxYSddweXZbdogSGQ","date":"2017-08-01T04:52:37","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9553024768829346,"text_excerpt":"The creamy pralines are so good and I've personally haven't came across this type of item many others places besides New Orleans. To describe pralines I would say they are a fudge type confection that has a wonderful rich, sweet flavor. I really like the creamy ones, but the hard ones are great as well. I've sampled a few around town and found this place to me the best. They offer samples so you can try before you commit to buying. Being able to browse around while sampling is a plus. The shop is in the tourist part of town so you should be able to squeeze this stop in."},{"business_id":"0uxg3_noVCE78Wgjb8DSyA","review_id":"QuyJ6-xnRcnxhPGve8Wj_g","date":"2011-10-20T02:18:23","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9442057609558105,"text_excerpt":"Along with beignets from Cafe du Monde next door, Aunt Sally's is a must-go-to when I'm in New Orleans. The pralines are legit - great to bring home with you for those less fortunate souls who weren't able to hit up the French Quarter with you. Biggies will run you a steep $3 or so... I prefer the little mini ones that you can purchase in a plastic case for $12. You get 12 mini pralines (100 calorie servings) - perfect serving size - of the creamy variety. I was curious about the praline pecans and now that I'm back in Texas, I'm regretting my \"man I don't want to spend $13 on a small box of pecans\" thought process... Shoulda went for it. I bet they're tasty. In the NOLA hotels, there is ..."},{"business_id":"0uxg3_noVCE78Wgjb8DSyA","review_id":"jbnQqiSM6uEAS3IacPYS6Q","date":"2014-07-24T17:46:12","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9415488243103027,"text_excerpt":"The pralines sold here are my most favorite. They are freshly made, and taste delicious! I regret not buying more packs of it to bring back home. Now that they have all been consumed, I just keep pondering when my next NOLA trip will be so I can go back to Aunt Sally's to eat some more of it! The pralines can be a bit too sweet for some, but eat it a little piece at a time just to savor the taste. *I recently came back to NOLA, and was so happy that I bought 3 boxes of 12 to take back home! YAY!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"0uxg3_noVCE78Wgjb8DSyA","photo_id":"HaPwBBriIz9M3RNLLOF4Ug","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/HaPwBBriIz9M3RNLLOF4Ug.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9215406179428101},{"business_id":"0uxg3_noVCE78Wgjb8DSyA","photo_id":"T14UEv9PQU7oo82g5vz-1g","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/T14UEv9PQU7oo82g5vz-1g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9141340851783752},{"business_id":"0uxg3_noVCE78Wgjb8DSyA","photo_id":"LJIi4VEC9OrUDo0OwVsUDw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/LJIi4VEC9OrUDo0OwVsUDw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8493086099624634}]},"notebook_case":null}
